<title>USA: IMM currencies close mostly lower, marks, yen lead.</title>
<headline>IMM currencies close mostly lower, marks, yen lead.</headline>
<text>
<p>April 9 - IMM currency futures closed mostly lower, with marks and yen ending near contract lows on heavy selling. Both contracts touched heavy sell-stop orders earlier in the afternoon. Funds were active sellers in June Can dollars, which ended lower after testing a major objective at $0.7262.</p>
